# The root .gitignore ignores `build/`, but desktop/build/ is electron-builder's
# buildResources dir and holds COMMITTED build inputs: entitlements + the app icon
# (icon.icns/icon.png compiled from the committed vector master icon.svg). These are
# required to package the app, so re-include the whole dir.
!build/
